  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Xiaohongshu Trending, Live & Note Scraper (RedNote / 小红书) — Automated Sheets, CSV & Slack Pipeline\n\nBuilt for market research, e-commerce, and growth teams. This workflow runs on a schedule to extract fresh data with the **[xiaohongshu-rednote-trend-scraper Apify Actor](https://apify.com/unitbytes/xiaohongshu-rednote-trend-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** ($0.0022 / item), skips previously seen records, scores each item, logs results to **Google Sheets** and **CSV**, and posts **Slack** alerts for top matches.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Every 6 Hours** triggers the run and loads search settings from **1. Configure Search & Rules**.\n2. **2. Run UnitBytes (xiaohongshu-rednote-trend-scraper)** executes the actor via Apify's synchronous endpoint.\n3. **3. Skip Seen Records** deduplicates items by `id` across runs.\n4. **4. Clean & Score Items** and **5. Map Export Fields** normalize fields (`itemType, id, roomId, title, type`) and compute a 0–100 `priorityScore`.\n5. **6a. Log to Google Sheets** and **6b. Export Backup CSV** store all rows, while **6c. Filter High-Priority Items** sends top matches to **7. Send Slack Alert**.\n\n### Setup\n1. Copy your API token from [xiaohongshu-rednote-trend-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/xiaohongshu-rednote-trend-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) into the **HTTP Header Auth** credential (`Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>`) on node 2.\n2. Edit `actorInput`, `sheetTab`, and `minEngagementScore` in **1. Configure Search & Rules**.\n3. Connect **Google Sheets** and **Slack** credentials (or test immediately via CSV export).\n\n### Customization\n- Tune `minEngagementScore` or `priorityKeyword` in node 1 to adjust Slack alert sensitivity.\n- Full schema reference: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/xiaohongshu-trend-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/xiaohongshu-trend-scraper/)",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "14f95d4f-1d25-546c-bed2-b6e723c49b89",
